==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} An [[endocrine gland]], about the size of a pea, that sits in a small, bony cavity at the base of the [[brain]] whose [[secretion]]s control the other endocrine glands and influence growth, [[metabolism]]{{,}} and [[maturation]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|glandula pituitaria}}
* {{l|en|hypophysis}}
* {{l|en|master gland}}
* {{l|en|pituitary body}}

